&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;US President Donald Trump has warned Iran of the possibility of another American military strike if Tehran fails to reach a diplomatic agreement with Washington. Speaking at a campaign rally in Florida, Trump suggested that the US could launch &quot;another little Epic Fury&quot; if negotiations do not lead to a deal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The president adopted a hardline stance towards Iran while highlighting his administration's national security record and criticising the Iranian leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
